<!-- The lamd memorandum Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs; docs/EVAL-LOOP.md,
     "Cross-engine gate") in the face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points;
     LR 10(a)(1): no smaller than standard 12-point); Body Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-body, LR 10(a)(1)
     double spacing) with a half-inch first-line indent (typst para-indent); single lines in 13.8 pt boxes (typst
     pitch-single); letter page, 1 in margins (LR 10(a)(1)). The footer: the page number centred in a 13.8 pt line box
     whose foot is 0.6 in above the bottom edge (footer="864"; LR 10(a)(1): no less than 1/2 inch from the bottom;
     typst footer-descent 15 pt). Headings, quotations, caption and signature lines carry their own spacing and
     indents (docx/lamd-motion-brief.lua). Twips: 20 x pt. -->
